{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Opposite sides of a regular hexagon are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> inches apart. The length of each side, in inches, is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/5/ba58b4e79434b2c3377d8ff4d2b62bd42eedf744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }7.5\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }6\\sqrt{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }5\\sqrt{2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\frac{9}{2}\\sqrt{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }4\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"470\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw a perpendicular through the midpoint of the line of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> such that it passes through a vertex. We now have created <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> triangles. Using the ratios, we get that the hypotenuse is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/9427a0dc06cb83c85658a97183a4fb4096efc523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times \\frac {2}{\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"58\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6ac8dd087c98eb1d8c8d87864e46ff63aa52e930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\frac {12}{\\sqrt {3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"46\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db91cc0538a308d74369d61a63ea6b49cb4653cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 4\\sqrt{3} \\rightarrow \\boxed {\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AH